{"3745020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Swarm Survivor: Endless Siege", "steam_appid": 3745020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A light-touch, ultra-satisfying space bullet-hell idle roguelite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are your swarm’s last hope—how long can you last against an endless tide of fleets?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal input</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No manual movement, no pickup chores. Combat is fully automated so you can focus on the mowing feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich builds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ skills, diverse heroes and enemies, different planets, plus relic and affix drops—every run has new combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire battle runs smoothly from 1× to 4× speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/4b54b73dbceec23e0f42f12a7171e68d.poster.avif?t=1785078586\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/4b54b73dbceec23e0f42f12a7171e68d.webm?t=1785078586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/4b54b73dbceec23e0f42f12a7171e68d.mp4?t=1785078586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Desktop small-window mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Park the game in a corner of your screen and let a run tick along while you work or browse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/120c30dd9b4cd9440b00836bd7ce607a.poster.avif?t=1785078586\" width=1170 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/120c30dd9b4cd9440b00836bd7ce607a.webm?t=1785078586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/120c30dd9b4cd9440b00836bd7ce607a.mp4?t=1785078586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Endless mode, manage your in-run resources and see how long you can survive under relentless waves.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A light-touch, ultra-satisfying space bullet-hell idle roguelite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are your swarm’s last hope—how long can you last against an endless tide of fleets?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal input</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No manual movement, no pickup chores. Combat is fully automated so you can focus on the mowing feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich builds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ skills, diverse heroes and enemies, different planets, plus relic and affix drops—every run has new combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire battle runs smoothly from 1× to 4× speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/4b54b73dbceec23e0f42f12a7171e68d.poster.avif?t=1785078586\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/4b54b73dbceec23e0f42f12a7171e68d.webm?t=1785078586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745020/extras/4b54b73dbceec23e0f42f12a7171e68d.mp4?t=1785078586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>